{"seq":1,"slug":"fundamentals","title":"分布式基础理论","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cap-and-base","title":"CAP 定理与 BASE","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/fundamentals/cap-and-base","wordCount":1216,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"consistency-models","title":"一致性模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/fundamentals/consistency-models","wordCount":1478,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"clocks-and-ordering","title":"分布式时钟与排序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/fundamentals/clocks-and-ordering","wordCount":1260,"readingTime":6},{"seq":4,"slug":"fault-models","title":"故障模型与容错","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/fundamentals/fault-models","wordCount":1570,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"分布式基础理论-简介\">分布式基础理论 简介</h1><p>分布式系统是由多台通过网络互联的计算机协同工作的系统。理解分布式系统的基础理论——CAP 定理、一致性模型、分布式时钟和故障模型——是设计可靠分布式架构的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章内容\">本章内容</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>节</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>核心要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>01</td>\n<td>CAP 定理与 BASE</td>\n<td>不可能三角、BASE 哲学、实际权衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>02</td>\n<td>一致性模型</td>\n<td>强一致、最终一致、因果一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>03</td>\n<td>分布式时钟与排序</td>\n<td>Lamport 时钟、向量时钟、混合逻辑时钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>04</td>\n<td>故障模型与容错</td>\n<td>崩溃故障、拜占庭故障、容错策略</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"学习路径\">学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[CAP 定理] --&gt; B[一致性模型]&#10;  B --&gt; C[分布式时钟]&#10;  C --&gt; D[故障模型]&#10;  D --&gt; E[一致性协议]\">graph LR\n  A[CAP 定理] --&gt; B[一致性模型]\n  B --&gt; C[分布式时钟]\n  C --&gt; D[故障模型]\n  D --&gt; E[一致性协议]</pre><h2 id=\"核心观点\">核心观点</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>没有银弹</strong>：分布式系统设计是一系列权衡，CAP 定理揭示了不可兼得的约束</li>\n<li><strong>一致性是谱系</strong>：从线性一致到最终一致，不同应用需要不同级别的保证</li>\n<li><strong>时间是幻觉</strong>：分布式环境中不存在全局时钟，事件排序需要逻辑时钟</li>\n<li><strong>故障是常态</strong>：设计分布式系统时必须假设网络分区、节点崩溃随时可能发生</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>计算机网络基础（TCP/IP、延迟概念）</li>\n<li>数据库事务基础（ACID）</li>\n<li>并发编程基础（锁、竞态条件）</li>\n</ul>\n"}